<!DOCTYPE html> 
<html lang="en"> 
  <head> 
    <meta charset="UTF-8" /> 
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Password Reset Successful - Cyberpunk</title> 
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@500;700;900&family=Share+Tech+Mono&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style> 
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }
      body { 
        font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace; 
        background-color: #030308; 
        /* Ultra Dark Grid Background */
        background-image: 
          radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.05) 0%, transparent 60%),
          linear-gradient(rgba(0, 253, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
          linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 253, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
        background-size: 100% 100%, 20px 20px, 20px 20px;
        color: #a9b1d6; 
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 20px;
        overflow: hidden;
        position: relative;
      } 

      /* CRT Scanline Overlay */
      body::after {
        content: " ";
        display: block;
        position: absolute;
        top: 0; left: 0; bottom: 0; right: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(rgba(18, 16, 16, 0) 50%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35) 50%);
        background-size: 100% 4px;
        z-index: 10;
        pointer-events: none;
      }

      .container { 
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 480px; 
        background: rgba(8, 9, 15, 0.95); 
        padding: 40px 30px; 
        border: 1px solid #00ff66;
        box-shadow: 
          0 0 25px rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.25),
          inset 0 0 20px rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.05); 
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        /* Cyberpunk Dual Cut Corners */
        clip-path: polygon(0 15px, 15px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 15px), calc(100% - 15px) 100%, 0 100%);
      } 

      /* Top Status Bar */
      .status-bar {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
        font-size: 10px;
        color: #00ff66;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        margin-bottom: 25px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.2);
        padding-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .status-dot {
        width: 8px;
        height: 8px;
        background-color: #00ff66;
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: inline-block;
        box-shadow: 0 0 8px #00ff66;
        animation: blink 1.5s infinite;
      }

      @keyframes blink {
        0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
        50% { opacity: 0.3; }
      }

      .icon-wrapper {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .icon { 
        display: inline-flex; 
        align-items: center; 
        justify-content: center; 
        width: 60px; 
        height: 60px; 
        background: #020305; 
        color: #00ff66; 
        font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
        font-size: 28px; 
        font-weight: bold; 
        border: 1px solid #00ff66;
        box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.4), inset 0 0 10px rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.2);
        clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 25%, 100% 75%, 50% 100%, 0% 75%, 0% 25%);
      } 

      h2 {
        font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
        color: #00ff66;
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 900;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        text-align: center;
        text-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.6);
      }

      p {
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #c0caf5;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
      }

      .user-name {
        color: #ffe600;
        font-weight: bold;
        text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 230, 0, 0.6);
      }

      .alert-text {
        color: #ff0055;
        font-weight: bold;
      }

      .footer { 
        margin-top: 35px; 
        font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
        font-size: 10px; 
        color: #565f89; 
        text-align: center;
        border-top: 1px dashed rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.2);
        padding-top: 18px;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
      } 

      /* Corner Accents */
      .corner-accent {
        position: absolute;
        width: 10px;
        height: 10px;
        border: 2px solid #00f3ff;
      }
      .top-right { top: 0; right: 0; border-left: none; border-bottom: none; }
      .bottom-left { bottom: 0; left: 0; border-right: none; border-top: none; }
    </style> 
  </head> 
  <body> 
    <div class="container"> 
      <div class="corner-accent top-right"></div>
      <div class="corner-accent bottom-left"></div>

      <div class="status-bar">
        <span><span class="status-dot"></span> AUTH_UPDATE_SUCCESS</span>
        <span>SYS.V_2.0.4</span>
      </div>

      <div class="icon-wrapper">
        <div class="icon">&#10003;</div>
      </div>

      <h2>Password Reset Successful</h2> 

      <p>Hello <span class="user-name"><%= name %></span>, your security credentials have been successfully updated in the system.</p> 

      <p>You can now log in to your <strong>PH Healthcare System</strong> account using your new password.</p> 

      <p class="alert-text">[!] If you did not authorize this action, please contact support immediately.</p> 

      <div class="footer">
        [ SYSTEM: PH HEALTHCARE // SECURE PROTOCOL ]
      </div> 
    </div> 
  </body> 
</html>